/T (May 23 2019, marked the day of the completion of the spin-off of Kontoor Brands. The Jeanswear arm was notoriously working-capital heavy, and consequently, inventory days and WC-to-sales fell, while the current ratio experienced a modest increase. Furthermore, the slow-paying denim customers departed with Kontoor. This was realised with improving debtor days \(event F\). )
/E (May 23 2019, marked the day of the completion of the spin-off of Kontoor Brands. The Jeanswear arm was notoriously working-capital heavy, and consequently, inventory days and WC-to-sales fell, while the current ratio experienced a modest increase. Furthermore, the slow-paying denim customers departed with Kontoor. This was realised with improving debtor days \(event F\). )
